<article class="container my-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <header class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-success-subtle text-success mb-3 px-3 py-2">
          <i class="bi bi-truck me-1"></i>Singapore collection guide
        </span>
        <h1 class="display-4 mb-3 text-success lh-sm">E-Waste Pickup & Collection Services</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">Find the most convenient way to hand over electronics that cannot go into a nearby bin</p>
        <div class="border-bottom border-success border-3 mx-auto" style="width: 60px;"></div>
      </header>

      <section class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-4">Which service should I use?</h2>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <i class="bi bi-box-seam text-success fs-2"></i>
                <h3 class="h5 mt-3">Buying a replacement</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">Ask the retailer for free one-for-one take-back of the same type of regulated consumer product when the new item is delivered.</p>
                <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success">Usually the easiest option</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <i class="bi bi-buildings text-success fs-2"></i>
                <h3 class="h5 mt-3">Living in an HDB flat</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Contact your Town Council to ask about bulky-item removal. State clearly that the item is an electrical appliance so it can enter the correct recycling stream.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <i class="bi bi-house-door text-success fs-2"></i>
                <h3 class="h5 mt-3">Need doorstep pickup</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Residential users can contact ALBA to arrange collection. Qualifying large household appliances are collected free of charge; costs for other e-waste vary.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <i class="bi bi-calendar-event text-success fs-2"></i>
                <h3 class="h5 mt-3">Can wait for a local event</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Check ALBA's schedule for quarterly e-waste collection drives in residential areas, or bring accepted regulated products to its Tuas depot.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-4">Before you book</h2>
        <div class="accordion shadow-sm" id="pickupChecklist">
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h3 class="accordion-header" id="pickupHeadingOne">
              <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#pickupOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="pickupOne">1. Identify the item</button>
            </h3>
            <div id="pickupOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="pickupHeadingOne" data-bs-parent="#pickupChecklist">
              <div class="accordion-body">Have the item type, quantity, approximate size, and condition ready. Mention leaking batteries, cracked screens, or other damage.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h3 class="accordion-header" id="pickupHeadingTwo">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#pickupTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pickupTwo">2. Confirm eligibility and cost</button>
            </h3>
            <div id="pickupTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="pickupHeadingTwo" data-bs-parent="#pickupChecklist">
              <div class="accordion-body">Ask whether every item is accepted, whether a fee applies, and whether disconnection or dismantling must be arranged separately. Do not assume that ordinary furniture is included with an e-waste booking.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h3 class="accordion-header" id="pickupHeadingThree">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#pickupThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pickupThree">3. Describe access conditions</button>
            </h3>
            <div id="pickupThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="pickupHeadingThree" data-bs-parent="#pickupChecklist">
              <div class="accordion-body">Tell the service about your floor, lift access, stairs, parking restrictions, narrow doors, and any condominium or building booking rules.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h3 class="accordion-header" id="pickupHeadingFour">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#pickupFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pickupFour">4. Prepare for collection</button>
            </h3>
            <div id="pickupFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="pickupHeadingFour" data-bs-parent="#pickupChecklist">
              <div class="accordion-body">Erase personal data, remove personal belongings, empty appliances, secure loose parts, and keep the item dry. Only disconnect or move it if this can be done safely.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="alert alert-warning border-start border-warning border-4 mb-5" role="alert">
        <h2 class="h5 alert-heading"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2"></i>A pickup request is not a dumping permit</h2>
        <p class="mb-0">Keep the item inside your home or at the agreed collection point until the scheduled time. Do not leave it in a corridor, beside a bin, or at a collection site that does not accept it.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-success-subtle rounded-3 p-4 p-md-5 mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-3">Book or find another collection route</h2>
        <p>Use the provider's current page to confirm its accepted-item list and arrange a date. For smaller electronics, Bin Buddy can help you locate a suitable drop-off point instead.</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-3 mt-4">
          <a href="https://alba-ewaste.sg/doorstep-collection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-success">
            Visit ALBA Doorstep Collection <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-1"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="/map" class="btn btn-outline-success">
            <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i>Find a Drop-off Point
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border-top pt-4 mb-4">
        <h2 class="h5 text-success mb-3">Official resources</h2>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Always confirm the latest arrangements directly with the service provider.</p>
        <a href="https://www.nea.gov.sg/our-services/waste-management/3r-programmes-and-resources/e-waste-management/where-to-recycle-e-waste" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="me-3">NEA: Collection options <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right small"></i></a>
        <a href="https://www.nea.gov.sg/our-services/waste-management/waste-management-infrastructure/refuse-disposal-facility/waste-disposal/bulk-item-disposal-disposal-of-garden-wastes-and-dead-pets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NEA: Bulky-item disposal <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right small"></i></a>
      </section>

      <footer class="border-top pt-4 mt-5 d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-sm-center gap-3">
        <p class="text-muted mb-0"><small><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i>Information checked: July 2026</small></p>
        <a href="/articles" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back to Articles</a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
